LowStockItemDto.description:
One item below one of its reorder points, as listed by `GET /api/v1/items/low-stock`.
Computed on request from the reorder points (the app's Reorder → Thresholds) and current stock;
the same rule as the Reorder page's alerts, but reading it creates no alert.

ScheduleGroupDto.description:
A scheduling group (division, crew or team) of the calling organization, as returned by
`GET /api/v1/schedule-groups`. Groups form a tree via `parentGroupId`;
a user may belong to several groups. Requires the `scheduling` module.

ShipSalesOrderApiRequest.description:
Body of `POST /api/v1/sales-orders/{id}/ship`. Example:
`{ "transferId": 904, "carrier": "UPS", "trackingNumber": "1Z999AA10123456784", "shippingMethod": "Ground" }`;
without tracking: `{ "transferId": 904, "withoutTracking": true }`.
